<span aria-hidden="true" class="chapter-toggle">+</span></summary><div class="chapter-body prose"><figure class="content-photo"><img alt="landscape architecture" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/landscape-architecture.webp"/></figure></div>
